      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "There are also a few news items to go over quickly.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A clean, minimalist white background features a black horizontal pill-shaped element moving from right to left into the center. A small black circle with a number is also present. The lighting is flat and uniform across the white surface. No subjects or products are present.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "NVIDIA and ComfyUI have released a set of nodes.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A stylized, cinematic shot of a dark sports car wheel with a bright yellow rim, rotating rapidly. The lighting is high-contrast with dark blues and blacks. The camera is static, focusing on the mechanical movement of the spinning tire.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:03",
          "timestamp_start": "0:02"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Super resolution, interpolation, and HDR conversion all run on your own graphics card.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "Close-up of a license plate on a red car. The camera is static. To the right, a split-screen comparison shows a visual enhancement process on automotive parts (exhaust pipes). The lighting transitions from natural daylight to a more saturated, high-contrast digital look. The colors are vibrant with deep blacks and neon highlights.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 3,
          "timestamp_end": "0:05",
          "timestamp_start": "0:04"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Super resolution, interpolation, and HDR conversion all run on your own graphics card.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "A digital render of a dark sports car with a large yellow rear wing drifting on a blue surface. The car emits blue sparks from its tires. The camera is positioned at a low angle behind the car, following its movement. The lighting is cool-toned with bright blue artificial accents.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 4,
          "timestamp_end": "0:07",
          "timestamp_start": "0:06"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Meta has released Muse Wonder.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A user interface display showing a document and a chat window. The interface is clean and white. A digital cursor mimics interaction with the text. The lighting is simulated screen glow, neutral and bright.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 5,
          "timestamp_end": "0:09",
          "timestamp_start": "0:08"
        },
        {
          "audio": "It emphasizes good memory and remembers things you've said before, then helps you handle them.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "Motion graphics featuring abstract white cards against a light gray background. Purple icons and black circular bubbles appear and stack. The motion is smooth and floaty. The color palette is dominated by white, soft gray, and accents of purple.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
          "scene_number": 6,
          "timestamp_end": "0:12",
          "timestamp_start": "0:10"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Microsoft has released a dedicated model for judgment.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A detailed bar chart comparing technical data benchmarks. The background is white. Rows of data in green and gray represent different models. The camera is static, presenting a clean data visualization interface.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 7,
          "timestamp_end": "0:15",
          "timestamp_start": "0:13"
        },
        {
          "audio": "It's called Decision-1, and it handles classification, assignment, and prioritization, giving you answers in just a few seconds.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A zoomed-in view of the previous bar chart, highlighting a specific row. Overlaid on the chart are four black circular bubbles containing white text. The focus is on the top line of the data table. The lighting is consistent with a computer monitor display.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 8,
